2011) Afr. J. Microbiol, 10, pp. 7585-7591;<br/>Gosavi, S.A., Studies on legume-rhizobium and mycorrhizal interaction with special reference to Phaseolus radiatus L. And Phaseolus aconitifolius Jack (2013) Indian Streams Res. J, 3, pp. 1-4;<br/>Harris, D., Pacovsky, R.S., Paul, E.A., Carbon economy of soybean Rhizobium Glomus associations (2013) New Phytol, 101, pp. 427-440;<br/>Djebali, N., Turki, S., Zib, M., Hajlaoui, M.R., Growth and development responses of some legume species inoculated with a mycorrhiza based biofertilizer (2010) Agr. Biol. J. North Am, 1, pp. 748-754;<br/>Bhat, M.I., Wani, J.A., Najar, G.R., Role of Rhizobium and VAM fungi for improvement in fertility and yield of green gram under temperate conditions. J (2009) Indian Soc. Soil Sci, 57, pp. 45-52;<br/>Safapour, M., Ardakani, M., Khaghani, S., Rejali, F., Zargari, K., Changizi, M., Teimuri, M., Response of yield and yield components of three red bean (Phaseolus vulgaris L.) (2011) American-Eurasian J. Agr. Environ. Sci, 11, pp. 398-405;<br/>Dania, S.O., Fagbola, O., Yamu, M.I., Assessment of the effects of arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi (Glomus clarum) and pigeon pea hedgerow on the yield of maize and soil properties in degraded ultisols (2013) J. Biol. Agr. Healthc, 3, pp. 44-56;<br/>Salih, S.H., Hamd, S.A., Dagash, Y.M.I., The effects of rhizobium, mycorrhizal inoculations and diammonium phosphate (DAP) on nodulation, growth, and yield of soybean. Univers (2015) J. Agr. Res, 3, pp. 11-14;<br/>Rasaei, B., Ghobadi, M.E., Nadjaphy, A., Rasaei, A., The study effects of some biological agents on Chickpea (Cicer arietinum L.) under semi-dry conditions in Kermanshah (2012) Eur. J. Exp. Biol, 2, pp. 1113-1118;<br/>Singh, J.S., Singh, B.N., Singh, T., Response of Cowpea (Vigna Unguicualata L. Walp.) to phosphorus levels and microbial inoculation (2005) Veg. Sci, 32, pp. 203-204;<br/>Guriqbal, S.H., Sekhon, S., Poonam Singh, G., Sharma, P., Effect of rhizobium, vesicular arbuscular mycor rhiza and phos