ve the growth and nodulation of the annual legume messina (Melilotus siculus) under saline and non-saline conditions (2012) Crop Pasture Sci., 63, pp. 164-178;<br/>Wipf, D., Krajinski, F., van Tuinen, D., Recorbet, G., Courty, P.E., Trading on the arbuscular mycorrhiza market: from arbuscules to common mycorrhizal networks (2019) New Phytol., 223, pp. 1127-1142;<br/>Zhang, Z., Schwartz, S., Wagner, L., Miller, W., A greedy algorithm for aligning DNA sequences (2000) J. Comput. Biol., 7, pp. 203-214;<br/>Zhou, C., Li, X., Zhou, Z., Li, C., Zhang, Y., Comparative transcriptome analysis identifies genes involved in diosgenin biosynthesis in Trigonella foenum-graecum L (2019) Molecules, 24, p. 140},
