 pp. 1603-1611;<br/>Mila i Canals, L., Chenoweth, J., Chapagain, A., Orr, S., Anton, A., Clift, R., Assessing freshwater use impacts in LCA: part I – inventory modelling and characterisation factors for the main impact pathways (2009) Int. J. Life Cycle Assess., 14 (1), pp. 28-42;<br/>Nieminen, E., Linke, M., Tobler, M., Vander Beke, B., EU COST Action 628: life cycle assessment (LCA) of textile products, eco-efficiency and definition of best available technology (BAT) of textile processing (2007) J. Clean. Prod., 15 (13-14), pp. 1259-1270;<br/>OECD, Eco-efficiency (1998), Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development Paris; Parisi, M.L., Fatarella, E., Spinelli, D., Pogni, R., Basosi, R., Environmental impact assessment of an eco-efficient production for coloured textiles (2015) J. Clean. Prod., 108, pp. 514-524;<br/>Radjenović, J., Matošić, M., Mijatović, I., Petrović, M., Barceló, D., Membrane Bioreactor (MBR) as an Advanced Wastewater Treatment Technology (2008) The Handbook of Environmental Chemistry, 5, pp. 37-101;<br/>Schaltegger, S., Sturm, A., Ecology Induced Management Decision Support. Starting Points for Instrument Formulation (1989), WWZ-Discussion Paper No. 8914 Wirtschaftswissenschaftliches Zentrum (WWZ), Universität Basel; Stavale, A.E., Smart Pumping Systems: the Time is Now (2001), ITT Industries, Fluid Technology Corporation Unpublished White Paper; UN ESCAP, Eco-efficiency Indicators: Measuring Resource-use Efficiency and the Impact of Economic Activities on the Environment (2009), United Nations Publication ST/ESCAP/2561; UNWATER, The United Nations World Water Development Report (2009) Water in a Changing World, 3. , UNESCO Publishing;<br/>Van Caneghem, J., Block, C., Cramm, P., Mortier, R., Vandecasteele, C., Improving eco-efficiency in the steel industry: the ArcelorMittal Gent case (2010) J. Clean. Prod., 18 (8), pp. 807-814;<br/>WBCSD., Eco-efficiency-Creating More Value with Less Impact (2000), World Business Council for Sustainable Development; Wursthorn, S., Poganietz, W.-R., Schebek, L., Economic–environmental monitoring indicators for European countries: a disaggregated sector-based approach for monitoring eco-efficiency (2011) Ecol. Econ., 70 (3), pp. 487-496;<br/>Yonar, T., Decolorization of textile dyeing effluents using advanced oxidation processes (2011) Advances in Treating Textile, , P. Hauser;<br/>You, S., Cheng, S., Yan, H., The impact of textile industry on China's environment (2009) Int. J. Fash. Des. Technol. Educ., 2 (1), pp. 33-34},
