@misc{Ma2020c,
   abstract = {The invention discloses a power plant tail water reuse processing device, and further discloses a power plant tail water reuse processing method. The power plant tail water reuse processing device comprises a dam, wherein the dam is provided with power generating equipment, a drain pipe is disposed on one side of the dam, and the power generating equipment is located in the drain pipe; a drainagechannel is disposed on one side of the dam, and the drain pipe corresponds to the drainage channel; a buffer pool is disposed one side of the dam, and the lower end of the drainage channel is connected to one side of the buffer pool; a soil layer is arranged on the other side of the buffer pool, and the upper end of the soil layer is dug with a tail water channel; and a concrete layer is laid on the circumferential side wall in the tail water channel, and gravel layers are laid on the opposite side walls of the concrete layer. According to the power plant tail water reuse processing device andmethod, the function of recycling tail water is realized, the situation that a lot of water resources are wasted due to the fact that the tail water cannot be reused is avoided, the cost is saved, the development and utilization value of the tail water is improved, the operation is simple, and the use is convenient.},
   author = {Jinlu Ma and Chen Shi},
