@misc{Ma2020b,
   abstract = {The invention discloses a solar energy green building with a water saving device, and belongs to the field of green buildings. The solar energy green building with the water saving device comprises agreen building body, a first electric stretchable rod, an induced draft fan, a corrugated tube and a second electric stretchable rod; the induced draft fan is fixedly connected with the side wall of the green building body, the first electric stretchable rod and the second electrical rod are fixedly connected with the top end of the green building body, an installing plate is arranged at the upperside of the first electric stretchable rod, the first electric stretchable rod and the second electric stretchable rod are both connected with the installing plate, an air separating pipe is fixedlyconnected to the installing plate, the corrugated tube is connected between the induced draft fan and the air separating pipe, a plurality of solar cell panel bodies are fixedly connected to the installing plate, a plurality of evenly-distributed water collecting grooves are dug in the installing plate, a flow guiding pipe is fixedly connected to the end, away from the air separating pipe, of thewater collecting groove. Rainwater can be easily collected and recycled, water is saved easily, assembling and disassembling are convenient, and maintenance is convenient.},
