   author = {C Abbafati and K M Abbas and M Abbasi and M Abbasifard and M Abbasi-Kangevari and H Abbastabar and F Abd-Allah and A Abdelalim and M Abdollahi and I Abdollahpour and A Abedi and P Abedi and K H Abegaz and H Abolhassani and A E Abosetugn and V Aboyans and E M Abrams and L G Abreu and M R M Abrigo and A K Abu Haimed and A Abualhasan and E Abu-Gharbieh and L J Abu-Raddad and A I Abushouk and A Acebedo and I N Ackerman and M Adabi and T Adair and A A Adamu and O M Adebayo and I A Adedeji and V Adekanmbi and J D Adelson and A M Adeoye and O O Adetokunboh and D Adham and S M Advani and M Afarideh and M Afshari and A Afshin and E E Agardh and G Agarwal and P Agasthi and K M Agesa and M Aghaali and S M K Aghamir and A Agrawal and T Ahmad and A Ahmadi and K Ahmadi and M Ahmadi and H Ahmadieh and E Ahmadpour and M B Ahmed and B Aji and T Y Akalu and R O Akinyemi and T Akinyemiju and B Akombi and C J Akunna and F Alahdab and Z Al-Aly and K Alam and N Alam and S Alam and T Alam and F M Alanezi and T M Alanzi and S B Albertson and J E Alcalde-Rabanal and N M Alema and B W Alemu and Y M Alemu and K F Alhabib and R K Alhassan and M Ali and S Ali and G Alicandro and M Alijanzadeh and C Alinia and V Alipour and H Alizade and S M Aljunid and F Alla and P Allebeck and M A H Almadi and A Almasi and A Almasi-Hashiani and N A Almasri and H M Al-Mekhlafi and A M Almulhim and J Alonso and R M Al-Raddadi and K A Altirkawi and A K Alumran and N Alvis-Guzman and N J Alvis-Zakzuk and A T Amare and B Amare and S Amini and M Amini-Rarani and A Aminorroaya and F Amiri and A M L Amit and D A Amugsi and G G H Amul and E W Anbesu and R Ancuceanu and D Anderlini and J A Anderson and C L Andrei and T Andrei and S Androudi and C Angus and M Anjomshoa and F Ansari and I Ansari and A Ansari-Moghaddam and I C Antonazzo and C A T Antonio and C M Antony and E Antriyandarti and D Anvari and R Anwer and S C Y Appiah and J Arabloo and M Arab-Zozani and A Y Aravkin and A A K Arba and O Aremu and F 