   keywords = {Chemical Free Production,Chemical free production,Income Generation,Income generation,Quality Vegetable Management Center,Quality vegetable management center},
   note = {<b>From Duplicate 1 (<i>Poor farmer, entrepreneurs and ICT relation in production &amp; marketing of quality vegetables in Bangladesh</i> - Ahmed, M; Ozaki, A; Ogata, K; Ito, S; Miyajima, I; Ahmed, A; Okayasu, T; Choudhury, D K; Al Amin, N)<br/></b><br/><b>From Duplicate 2 (<i>Poor farmer, entrepreneurs and ICT relation in production &amp; marketing of quality vegetables in Bangladesh</i> - Ahmed, M; Ozaki, A; Ogata, K; Ito, S; Miyajima, I; Ahmed, A; Okayasu, T; Choudhury, D K; Al Amin, N)<br/></b><br/>Cited By :4<br/><br/>Export Date: 10 July 2021<br/><br/>Correspondence Address: Ozaki, A.; Institute of Tropical Agriculture, Japan; email: a-ozaki@agr.kyushu-u.ac.jp<br/><br/>Funding details: Georgia Cancer Coalition, GCC<br/><br/>Funding details: Japan International Cooperation Agency, JICA<br/><br/>Funding details: Bangladesh Agricultural Research Institute, BARI<br/><br/>Funding details: Waterloo Institute for Nanotechnology, University of Waterloo, WIN<br/><br/>Funding text 1: The authors are thankful to BSMRAU, WIN, GCC and BARI authority for their excellent cooperation in implementing the project. In addition we received generous support from JICA. Here we would like to express the deepest appreciation to all of the organizations.<br/><br/>References: Hossain, A., Rahman, M., Development strategy for the disadvantaged youth in rural area of Bangladesh (2012) European Scientific Journal, 8 (22), pp. 62-75; <br/>Hossain, M.A., Moniruzzaman, M., Islam, M.A., Urban environment health in Mondal, M. H. 2010 crop agriculture of Bangladesh: Challenges and opportunities (2010) Bangladesh Journal of Agricultural Research, 35 (2), pp. 235-245;<br/>Okonwu, K., Menash, S.I., Effects of npk (15:15:15) fertilizer on some growth indices of pumpkin (2012) Asian Journal of Agricultural Research, 6 (3), pp. 137-143;<br/>Rahman, M.M., Rahman, G.K.M.M., Afrad, M.S.I., Islam, S., Effect of organic composts in red amaranth and spinach productivity and soil fertility (2014)