SPSS for Windows (Version 12), , 2nd ed. Milton Keynes: Open University Press;<br/>Rajalahti, R., (2009) Promoting Agricultural Innovation Systems Approaches: The Way Forwards., , http//knowledge.cta.int/en/content/view/full/9564;<br/>Skarstein, R., Economic liberalization and smallholder productivity in Tanzania. From promised success to real failure, 1985-1998 (2005) Journal of Agrarian Change, 5 (3), pp. 334-362;<br/>Smith, K., Innovation as a systematic phenomena: Rethinking the role of policy (2000) A System Failure Framework for Innovation Policy design”, Technovation, 25, pp. 609-619. , R. Klein Woolthuis, M. Lankhuizen, and V. Gilsing. 2005;<br/>Spielman, D.J., (2005) Innovation Systems Perspectives on Developing-Country Agriculture: A Critical Review, 2, p. 64;<br/>Sumberg, J., Systems of innovation theory and the changing architecture of agricultural research in Africa (2005) Food Policy, 30 (1), pp. 21-41;<br/>Thornton, P., Dyer, K., Lawson, A., Olney, G., Olsen, H., Pennarz, J., (2011) Joint Irish Aid and DFID Country Programme Evaluation Tanzania 2004/05-2009/10, , http://www.oecd.org/countries/Tanzania/48156699.pdf, Irish Aid/Department for International Development;<br/>(2003) Agricultural Sector Development Programme Framework and Process Document, , Ministry of Agricultural Food Security and Cooperatives (MAFSC) and Ministry of Livestock and Fisheries Development (MLFD), Monitoring and Evaluation (M&amp;E) Report. Northern Zone;<br/>(2013) National Agricultural Policy, , (Draft) Dar es Salaam: Ministry of Agricultural Food Security and Cooperatives;<br/>(2010) National Research and Development Policy, , Dar es Salaam: Ministry of Communications and Science and Technology;<br/>(2008) Guidelines for Extension Services Providers in Private Sector (In Swahili), , Dares Salaam: Ministry of Agricultural Food Security and Cooperatives;<br/>(2009) Guidelines for Extension Services Providers, , (in Swahili) Dares Salaam: Ministry of Agricultural Food and Coo