   abstract = {Vossloh MFL Rail Milling (VMRM) has developed under the brand umbrella of Vossloh Rail Services (VRS) an innovative solution for mobile rail milling. Behind the recently formed joint venture are the rail-experienced company Vossloh Rail Services (VRS) and the Austrian Maschinenfabrik Liezen und Giesserei Ges.m.b.H. (MFL) resulting in combined expertise in rail maintenance and mechanical engineering. The advantages of the new generation of rail millers are much superior rail surface quality, more material removal per pass and higher working speed. These rail maintenance products can operate on widely ranging jobs with a high degree of reliability and environmental sustainability. Mobile milling is an ideal supplement to preventive high speed grinding (HSG). Its public premiere was at InnoTrans 2012.},
